* official Analog Canvas netlist; PDK X cards rewritten by convert.py
.model nch nmos
.model pch pmos

.subckt dut VDD VSS VIN VS5 VS1 VS2 VS3 VS4 VP VB3 VREF VB1 VB2
.model DIODE D(IS=1e-14 N=1)
CFLY VX1 VX2 1p
CO VP VN 1p
COP VP VSS 1p
D1 VN VX2 DIODE
L1 VX1 VX3 1n
M1 VX1 VS1 VIN VDD pch l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
